{"id":"78f4720290075509","kind":"proposal","requestId":"6d391e9c64555176","createdAt":"2026-10-24T14:09:19.769Z","baseRevision":"d0e9accea457532d7cc870cf85d942d97e24416fa53381438b9f0e8de1b5075a","summary":"Colour per style.md: paper fill with ink stroke and text on every node; teal (link) stroke on the two flow actions, context and propose; one crimson accent on the focal node, the Mermaid view (accent stroke, accent-tint fill).","rationale":"Follows .aof/diagrams/style.md roles. Paper #f3f5f7 fill with ink #1b1f27 stroke and text on the operator, editor, scene, projection, architect and records nodes. The link role (teal #13766d) is for command and data flows, so it goes on the stroke of the two command boxes the architect's flow runs through: context and propose; text stays ink for contrast. The one focal accent is the Mermaid view, ADR-010's point (the architect's whole interface): crimson #ba2646 stroke, with accent-tint as its fill. The profile takes #rrggbb only, so accent-tint (crimson at 0.08) is flattened over paper to #eee4e9. Light-theme values; the frames, edges, ids, labels and layout are unchanged. No ADR amendment is implied.","base":"flowchart LR\n  %% aof:profile 1\n  subgraph iface[\"Interface: what the architect reads and writes\"]\n    projection[\"scene-view projection<br/>pure, server and editor\"]\n    view(\"Mermaid view<br/>aof profile\")\n  end\n  subgraph store[\"Store: everything the editor draws\"]\n    scene[\"Scene file<br/>diagrams/ADR-NNN-slug.excalidraw<br/>canonical, diffable\"]\n  end\n  operator((\"Operator\"))\n  editor[\"Excalidraw editor<br/>@aof/diagrams-ui\"]\n  context[\"context action\"]\n  architect((\"Architect\"))\n  propose[\"propose action\"]\n  records[\"Review records<br/>notes, answers, proposals\"]\n  operator -->|\"draws: library items, freehand, images\"| editor\n  editor -->|\"save: stamps customData.aof.id\"| scene\n  scene --> projection\n  projection -->|\"projects; sketches read-only\"| view\n  view --> con